# The model router — OPTIONAL, and deliberately so.
#
# Without this key North behaves exactly as it always has: `core/coach/intent.ts`
# routes every question deterministically, offline, in under a millisecond. The
# API route returns 204, the client uses its local answer, and nothing degrades.
# Every test in the suite passes with this file absent.
#
# With it, `app/api/intent/route.ts` classifies each question with Haiku before
# falling back. It buys ROUTING PRECISION, not coverage — "did I keep my
# promises" landing on `decisions` rather than the honest default of `standing`.
#
# What the model is allowed to do is one thing: return one of eleven labels via
# a forced tool call. It never composes a sentence, never sees a balance, and is
# never sent a question about markets — those are refused locally before the
# request is made. See docs/VOICE.md §5.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
